@startuml admin-gdpr-deletion
!include admin-common.puml
title Suppression de données utilisateur (RGPD)

== Suppression données utilisateur ==
Admin -> Frontend: Traiter demande suppression RGPD
Frontend -> API: POST /api/admin/users/{userId}/gdpr-delete
note right
Body: {confirmDeletion: true, reason}
end note
API -> Auth: Vérifier permissions admin
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> AdminCtrl: processGDPRDeletion(userId, reason)
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: anonymizeUserData(userId)

UserSvc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
UserSvc -> DB: UPDATE users SET email=deleted_user_{id}@deleted.com, name=[DELETED]
UserSvc -> DB: DELETE FROM user_sessions WHERE userId=?
UserSvc -> DB: UPDATE orders SET customer_email=[DELETED] WHERE userId=?
UserSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO deleted_users (original_id, deletion_reason, deleted_by)
UserSvc -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

UserSvc -> AuditSvc: logGDPRDeletion(userId, adminId, reason)
AuditSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action: gdpr_user_deleted)

UserSvc --> AdminCtrl: user data anonymized
AdminCtrl --> API: deletion complete
API --> Frontend: user deleted
Frontend --> Admin: Données utilisateur supprimées (RGPD)

@enduml